WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Chun-Li releases light Kikoken after holding back.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.050
Raw Drive Rush follows the projectile toward Ryu.

3
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.450
Standing medium punch connects as the fireball confirm continues.

4
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.150
Back heavy punch follows the Rush medium.

5
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.050
The Serenity Stream light kick connects after entering stance.

6
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.550
Medium Spinning Bird Kick finishes the confirm.

7
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.000
Both characters recover at the final spacing.
